Changes:
 verify-iso-sig (2026.08.02) mx; urgency=medium
 .
   * Add "Nothing to verify" and "Key not trusted" results, replacing
     misleading Verification FAILED cases; fix several related
     checksum-listing/signature edge cases.
   * Reword expired-key and unrecognized-key messages for clarity.
   * Redesign the picker: intro text for first-time users, a clearer
     warning icon, and drag-and-drop moved to an opt-in "Verify with
     Drag & Drop" menu action (--drag-and-drop).
